#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Noninteractive BearMail installer for BearPortal.

BearPortal calls this program with an input JSON file and a result path.
The program checks that contract, then runs install.sh and mcp_install.sh
from the artifact directory. It does not download a release and it does not
replace those installers.

BearPortal does not run install.sh and does not answer its prompts. This
program writes the easy-install answers to a mode 0600 file and starts
install.sh with stdin closed and no terminal. DNS publication for the
contract is done here, after the mail services are installed. install.sh
leaves the zone unchanged.
"""

